{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 605345766871201984,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Why Is the Network Stack So Complex?",
      "source_hash": 4200275611484805190,
      "context_hash": 10068878362672723426,
      "translation": "네트워크 스택은 왜 이렇게 복잡할까요?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "network stack": "네트워크 스택"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:05.447812Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "A mental model for the Linux networking subsystem",
      "source_hash": 11454369324383747013,
      "context_hash": 7020721111741172658,
      "translation": "Linux 네트워킹 서브시스템을 이해하기 위한 멘탈 모델",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Linux": "Linux",
        "subsystem": "서브시스템"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:05.447813Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "The fundamental challenge",
      "source_hash": 1891592033180381345,
      "context_hash": 17982400032667409023,
      "translation": "근본적인 과제",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:05.447813Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Networking is not a single problem — it's dozens of layered problems that must compose cleanly:",
      "source_hash": 10214713994849817891,
      "context_hash": 15058396675523352544,
      "translation": "네트워킹은 하나의 문제가 아니라, 깔끔하게 조합되어야 하는 수십 개의 계층화된 문제입니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:05.447813Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Different hardware (Ethernet, WiFi, InfiniBand, loopback)",
      "source_hash": 15672628196266211988,
      "context_hash": 16345082960204502247,
      "translation": "다양한 하드웨어(Ethernet, WiFi, InfiniBand, loopback)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "hardware": "하드웨어"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:05.447813Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Different address families (IPv4, IPv6, AF_UNIX, AF_PACKET)",
      "source_hash": 18156407360539889699,
      "context_hash": 8871182447644544671,
      "translation": "다양한 주소 패밀리(IPv4, IPv6, AF_UNIX, AF_PACKET)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "address": "주소"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:05.447813Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Different transport protocols (TCP, UDP, SCTP, DCCP)",
      "source_hash": 16831804069151926958,
      "context_hash": 17955905922196427612,
      "translation": "다양한 전송 프로토콜(TCP, UDP, SCTP, DCCP)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "TCP": "TCP",
        "UDP": "UDP"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:05.447813Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Different use cases (web servers, databases, real-time systems, containers)",
      "source_hash": 7841216529881172658,
      "context_hash": 9104461817028746318,
      "translation": "다양한 사용 사례(웹 서버, 데이터베이스, 실시간 시스템, 컨테이너)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:05.447813Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Hard requirements: correctness, performance, security, extensibility",
      "source_hash": 17064511872753759397,
      "context_hash": 4632718661959212853,
      "translation": "엄격한 요구 사항: 정확성, 성능, 보안, 확장성",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "correctness": "정확성"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:05.447813Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "The Linux network stack is complex because it solves all of these simultaneously, and has evolved over 30 years as each requirement was added.",
      "source_hash": 7753222682928760446,
      "context_hash": 16111416610489391193,
      "translation": "Linux 네트워크 스택이 복잡한 이유는 이 모든 문제를 동시에 해결하며, 요구 사항이 하나씩 추가될 때마다 30년에 걸쳐 발전해 왔기 때문입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Linux": "Linux",
        "network stack": "네트워크 스택"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:05.447813Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "The layer model",
      "source_hash": 414136326307032364,
      "context_hash": 17800178945443411631,
      "translation": "계층 모델",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:05.447813Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The stack mirrors the OSI/IP model, but in kernel terms:",
      "source_hash": 2216051402466016315,
      "context_hash": 14230067692042028426,
      "translation": "스택은 OSI/IP 모델을 그대로 반영하지만, 커널 관점에서는 다음과 같습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:05.447814Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Each layer adds/strips headers using the same `sk_buff` structure, pushing and pulling data pointers. **No data is copied between layers** — the same buffer passes through the entire stack.",
      "source_hash": 4288719957137982509,
      "context_hash": 17146044991911230490,
      "translation": "각 계층은 동일한 `sk_buff` 구조체를 사용하여 데이터 포인터를 push 및 pull하는 방식으로 헤더를 추가하거나 제거합니다. **계층 간에 데이터가 복사되지 않으며**, 동일한 버퍼가 스택 전체를 통과합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:05.447814Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "The receive path in one picture",
      "source_hash": 11197886302412915217,
      "context_hash": 4703200022911657968,
      "translation": "한눈에 보는 수신 경로",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:05.447814Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "The transmit path in one picture",
      "source_hash": 5834621492451876887,
      "context_hash": 15945255471137660826,
      "translation": "한눈에 보는 송신 경로",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:05.447814Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Why multiple abstraction layers?",
      "source_hash": 14955423824380884424,
      "context_hash": 10047800073773913205,
      "translation": "왜 여러 추상화 계층을 둘까요?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:05.447814Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "1.",
      "source_hash": 4093818885034029453,
      "context_hash": 16407281157346272141,
      "translation": "1\\.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:05.447814Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Flexibility without copying",
      "source_hash": 14986187565104146951,
      "context_hash": 3940796460113482711,
      "translation": "복사 없는 유연성",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:05.447814Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Each layer operates on the same `sk_buff`.",
      "source_hash": 1176952011540773296,
      "context_hash": 1844247803319725673,
      "translation": "각 계층은 동일한 `sk_buff` 위에서 동작합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:05.447814Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "TCP adds a TCP header by calling `skb_push()` — moving the `data` pointer back 20 bytes and writing the header there.",
      "source_hash": 5909570115204532877,
      "context_hash": 5238942618201856360,
      "translation": "TCP는 `skb_push()`를 호출하여 TCP 헤더를 추가합니다. 즉, `data` 포인터를 20바이트 뒤로 옮기고 그 위치에 헤더를 씁니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "TCP": "TCP",
        "bytes": "바이트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:05.447814Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:2/seg:2",
      "source": "IP does the same for its header.",
      "source_hash": 4200704028506767955,
      "context_hash": 14776986020492027382,
      "translation": "IP도 자신의 헤더에 대해 같은 작업을 수행합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:05.447814Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:2/seg:3",
      "source": "Ethernet does the same for its header. **Zero copies across layers** for the headers.",
      "source_hash": 15411044381743722619,
      "context_hash": 2876491527957547198,
      "translation": "Ethernet도 자신의 헤더에 대해 같은 작업을 수행합니다. 헤더에 대해서는 **계층 간 복사가 전혀 없습니다**.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:05.447814Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "2.",
      "source_hash": 1210270714770233551,
      "context_hash": 5722671386102168344,
      "translation": "2\\.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:05.447814Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "Protocol independence",
      "source_hash": 241520192834518827,
      "context_hash": 6994414881810850561,
      "translation": "프로토콜 독립성",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:05.447814Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "The socket layer doesn't know if the underlying transport is TCP or UDP. `proto_ops->sendmsg()` dispatches to the right implementation.",
      "source_hash": 8048704902635767384,
      "context_hash": 5892583574941067633,
      "translation": "소켓 계층은 하위 전송 계층이 TCP인지 UDP인지 알지 못합니다. `proto_ops->sendmsg()`가 올바른 구현으로 디스패치합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "TCP": "TCP",
        "UDP": "UDP"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:05.447814Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "Adding a new protocol (SCTP, QUIC in kernel, etc.) requires only implementing the right interfaces.",
      "source_hash": 493037053414734516,
      "context_hash": 18266065500214773712,
      "translation": "새 프로토콜(SCTP, 커널 내 QUIC 등)을 추가하려면 해당 인터페이스만 구현하면 됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:05.447815Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "3.",
      "source_hash": 414013015342266677,
      "context_hash": 12302138665763976064,
      "translation": "3\\.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:05.447815Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:5/seg:1",
      "source": "Extensibility via hooks",
      "source_hash": 7602479814017283910,
      "context_hash": 5438977464364509150,
      "translation": "훅을 통한 확장성",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "hooks": "훅"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:05.447815Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "**Netfilter** provides hooks at fixed points in the IP stack (PREROUTING, INPUT, FORWARD, OUTPUT, POSTROUTING).",
      "source_hash": 16437991702475332199,
      "context_hash": 3477244168704135826,
      "translation": "**Netfilter**는 IP 스택의 고정된 지점(PREROUTING, INPUT, FORWARD, OUTPUT, POSTROUTING)에 훅을 제공합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Netfilter": "Netfilter",
        "hooks": "훅"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:05.447815Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:6/seg:1",
      "source": "Firewalls, NAT, connection tracking, and packet mangling all attach at these hooks — without modifying the core stack.",
      "source_hash": 12987980470494456082,
      "context_hash": 807842429262581403,
      "translation": "방화벽, NAT, 연결 추적(connection tracking), 패킷 변조(packet mangling)는 모두 핵심 스택을 수정하지 않고 이 훅에 연결됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "hooks": "훅"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:05.447815Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "**XDP** hooks even earlier, before `sk_buff` allocation, for maximum performance.",
      "source_hash": 4165571594922416672,
      "context_hash": 15794353618173274162,
      "translation": "**XDP**는 최대 성능을 위해 그보다 더 이른 지점, 즉 `sk_buff` 할당 이전에 훅을 겁니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "XDP": "XDP",
        "hooks": "훅"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:05.447815Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "**eBPF socket programs** hook at the socket level for per-flow policy.",
      "source_hash": 6563091034048968062,
      "context_hash": 5101253735969561120,
      "translation": "**eBPF 소켓 프로그램**은 플로별 정책을 위해 소켓 수준에서 훅을 겁니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "eBPF": "eBPF",
        "hook": "훅",
        "policy": "정책"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:05.447815Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "4.",
      "source_hash": 14789025571905875223,
      "context_hash": 5491566170112327196,
      "translation": "4\\.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:00.443293Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:9/seg:1",
      "source": "NAPI for high-throughput",
      "source_hash": 25237360842747971,
      "context_hash": 7537626173926835816,
      "translation": "고처리량을 위한 NAPI",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "NAPI": "NAPI",
        "throughput": "처리량"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:00.443295Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "The interrupt-driven receive model doesn't scale.",
      "source_hash": 2051117712855187771,
      "context_hash": 17375373069424665696,
      "translation": "인터럽트 기반 수신 모델은 확장성이 없습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "interrupt": "인터럽트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:00.443296Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:10/seg:1",
      "source": "NAPI switches to polling under load, processing packets in batches in softirq context.",
      "source_hash": 15620838437265129089,
      "context_hash": 1427702967788007334,
      "translation": "NAPI는 부하가 걸리면 폴링 방식으로 전환하여 softirq 컨텍스트에서 패킷을 일괄 처리합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "NAPI": "NAPI",
        "softirq": "softirq"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:00.443297Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:10/seg:2",
      "source": "GRO merges segments.",
      "source_hash": 9974072149178346935,
      "context_hash": 762216825258910057,
      "translation": "GRO는 세그먼트를 병합합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:00.443298Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:10/seg:3",
      "source": "RSS distributes across CPUs.",
      "source_hash": 319853643510343325,
      "context_hash": 6379902394452289306,
      "translation": "RSS는 여러 CPU에 걸쳐 분산합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPUs": "CPU",
        "RSS": "RSS"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:00.443298Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:10/seg:4",
      "source": "All of this is layered on top of the core receive path.",
      "source_hash": 13699786957924600063,
      "context_hash": 5906230507074768308,
      "translation": "이 모든 것은 핵심 수신 경로 위에 계층화되어 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:00.443299Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Key data structures at a glance",
      "source_hash": 4379939584304517922,
      "context_hash": 8172996735506347779,
      "translation": "주요 자료 구조 한눈에 보기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "data structures": "자료 구조"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:00.443299Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Structure",
      "source_hash": 586716415752544071,
      "context_hash": 6691413940387636244,
      "translation": "구조체",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:00.443299Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Where",
      "source_hash": 6812873851527573074,
      "context_hash": 2574475196017234682,
      "translation": "위치",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:00.443300Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Purpose",
      "source_hash": 5472923780897967966,
      "context_hash": 16167848507992009338,
      "translation": "용도",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Purpose": "용도"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:00.443300Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
