    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Complexity by design, not accident",
      "source_hash": 6280370239077222837,
      "context_hash": 14820155330902581147,
      "translation": "우연이 아닌 설계에 따른 복잡성",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:06.681466Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The stack's complexity reflects genuine requirements:",
      "source_hash": 6189520935346933622,
      "context_hash": 5653363293384642224,
      "translation": "스택의 복잡성은 실제 요구 사항을 반영합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:06.681467Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "**TCP** must handle packet loss, reordering, congestion, flow control, and connection lifetime — it's inherently complex",
      "source_hash": 9738242821113030412,
      "context_hash": 2708169569189285547,
      "translation": "**TCP**는 패킷 손실, 순서 뒤바뀜, 혼잡, 흐름 제어, 연결 수명을 처리해야 하므로 본질적으로 복잡합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "TCP": "TCP"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:06.681467Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "**NAT** must track connection state to rewrite both directions — requires the conntrack subsystem",
      "source_hash": 11018046239295729400,
      "context_hash": 14760993584742747550,
      "translation": "**NAT**는 양방향을 모두 재작성하기 위해 연결 상태를 추적해야 하므로 conntrack 서브시스템이 필요합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "conntrack": "conntrack",
        "subsystem": "서브시스템"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:06.681467Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "**Multi-queue NICs** with RSS, RPS, XPS, and IRQ affinity require per-CPU state at every layer",
      "source_hash": 90300963894590166,
      "context_hash": 17418630127832621715,
      "translation": "RSS, RPS, XPS, IRQ 어피니티를 갖춘 **멀티 큐 NIC**는 모든 계층에서 CPU별 상태를 요구합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "IRQ": "IRQ",
        "NICs": "NIC",
        "RSS": "RSS",
        "affinity": "어피니티",
        "queue": "큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:06.681467Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "**Containers** with network namespaces require virtualizing the entire network stack",
      "source_hash": 10839424996907694390,
      "context_hash": 10582027784508887056,
      "translation": "네트워크 네임스페이스를 사용하는 **컨테이너**는 네트워크 스택 전체의 가상화를 요구합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "namespaces": "네임스페이스",
        "network stack": "네트워크 스택"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:06.681467Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "**Security** (nftables, seccomp, SELinux socket labels) requires hooks at multiple points",
      "source_hash": 2503158854481886984,
      "context_hash": 1328848032450957762,
      "translation": "**보안**(nftables, seccomp, SELinux 소켓 레이블)은 여러 지점에 훅을 요구합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "SELinux": "SELinux",
        "hooks": "훅",
        "seccomp": "seccomp"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:06.681468Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Understanding any one part (TCP, routing, Netfilter, NAPI) is tractable.",
      "source_hash": 11121295537420177787,
      "context_hash": 14407513435924439252,
      "translation": "어느 한 부분(TCP, 라우팅, Netfilter, NAPI)을 이해하는 것은 충분히 감당할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "NAPI": "NAPI",
        "Netfilter": "Netfilter",
        "TCP": "TCP"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:06.681468Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:7/seg:1",
      "source": "The stack as a whole is complex because it's many tractable parts that must compose perfectly.",
      "source_hash": 3553928128857688152,
      "context_hash": 5501576453613090908,
      "translation": "스택 전체가 복잡한 이유는, 각각은 감당할 수 있는 수많은 부분이 완벽하게 맞물려 동작해야 하기 때문입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:06.681468Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Where to go next",
      "source_hash": 8425074874143251993,
      "context_hash": 13194315324761334917,
      "translation": "다음 단계",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:39:06.681468Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
